4d-beta-2\">Publish from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-any-page\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow, any page<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-any-page\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>Put a Verse scene on a listing page, a product page or a blog post. Paste the link, or copy the code from Studio. The embed shows the scene&#39;s poster straight away, and the 3D viewer loads when a visitor scrolls to it. Pages stay fast, and a visitor who never scrolls that far downloads nothing of the engine.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-quickest-way-studio-embed\">The quickest way: Studio → Embed<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#the-quickest-way-studio-embed\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Open <a href=\"/studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-studio\">Studio</a>, find the scene and press <strong>Embed</strong>. One click copies the embed code and opens the Embed panel:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Shape</strong>: Landscape 16:9 (rooms and walkthroughs), 4:3, Square (products), Portrait 9:16 (phone-first pages).</li><li><strong>Width</strong>: full width of the page&#39;s column, or capped at 960 / 640 / 480 px.</li><li><strong>Load</strong>: <em>When visible</em> (default) or <em>On tap</em>. On tap, nothing loads until the visitor taps the poster. Use it on pages with several scenes.</li><li><strong>Copy</strong>: the HTML, the WordPress shortcode and the link. Steps for Shopify are listed there too.</li><li><strong>Preview</strong>: the real embed at the shape you chose.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"any-website-plain-html-wix-squarespace-framer-elementor\">Any website (plain HTML, Wix, Squarespace, Framer, Elementor)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#any-website-plain-html-wix-squarespace-framer-elementor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Paste the HTML into the builder&#39;s HTML or embed block:</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"html\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-html\">&lt;div style=&quot;position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;margin:0 auto&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;iframe src=&quot;https://verse.ctruh.com/embed?vpk=ingest/&lt;scene-id&gt;.vpk&quot; title=&quot;Palm villa — 3D view&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot;\n    allow=&quot;fullscreen; xr-spatial-tracking; accelerometer; gyroscope; magnetometer; autoplay; clipboard-write&quot; allowfullscreen\n    style=&quot;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;border-radius:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre></div>\n<p>The box fills its column at the shape you chose, on phones and desktops alike. Your page needs no special headers. The viewer runs on Verse&#39;s own site inside the frame, so your ads, analytics and other embeds are unaffected. The embed also works on a page that is itself cross-origin isolated (COOP/COEP).</p>\n<p>Options on the <code>src</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Add</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>&amp;load=tap</code></td><td>Load the 3D only when the visitor taps the poster</td></tr><tr><td><code>&amp;analytics=0</code></td><td>Count nothing from this embed</td></tr><tr><td><code>&amp;guard=0</code></td><td>The scene takes every gesture straight away. By default, vertical swipes and the mouse wheel scroll your page until the visitor taps or clicks the scene.</td></tr><tr><td><code>&amp;fs=0</code></td><td>Hide the fullscreen button</td></tr><tr><td><code>&amp;look=studio:warm</code>, <code>&amp;bg=ffffff</code></td><td>The same look options as the share link</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"wordpress\">WordPress<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#wordpress\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Install the <strong>Verse</strong> plugin. Get <code>verse-embed-1.1.0.zip</code> from Ctruh (it is not in the WordPress plugin directory yet), then go to <strong>Plugins → Add New → Upload Plugin</strong> and activate it. Then use any of these:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Paste the link</strong> on its own line, or into an <strong>Embed</strong> block: <code>https://verse.ctruh.com/?vpk=ingest/&lt;scene-id&gt;.vpk</code>. WordPress turns it into the viewer.</li><li><strong>Shortcode</strong>: <code>[verse url=&quot;https://verse.ctruh.com/?vpk=ingest/&lt;scene-id&gt;.vpk&quot; aspect=&quot;1:1&quot; width=&quot;640&quot; load=&quot;tap&quot;]</code>. Studio&#39;s Embed panel writes it for you.</li><li><strong>Block</strong>: <strong>Verse 3D viewer</strong> in the Embed category. It has fields for the link, shape, max width and when to load.</li></ul>\n<p>Why install the plugin instead of relying on discovery? WordPress can find Verse links without the plugin, but then it puts the frame in a sandbox that stops the 3D viewer. The plugin registers Verse as a trusted provider. Details: <code>integrations/embeds/wordpress/README.md</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"shopify-product-pages\">Shopify (product pages)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#shopify-product-pages\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The <strong>Verse 3D viewer</strong> app block goes on any product template of an Online Store 2.0 theme:</p>\n<ol><li>Online Store → Themes → <strong>Customize</strong> → a product template → <strong>Add block</strong> → <strong>Verse 3D viewer</strong>.</li><li>Paste the scene&#39;s link into <strong>Verse link</strong>. Pick the shape (Square suits products) and save.</li><li>For a different scene on each product, create a product metafield <code>verse.scene_url</code> (type URL), put each product&#39;s link there and leave the block&#39;s link empty.</li></ol>\n<p>The block ships as a Shopify theme app extension (<code>integrations/embeds/shopify/</code>). Ctruh installs it on your store with a private install link. There is no App Store listing yet.</p>\n<h2 id=\"webflow\">Webflow<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#webflow\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Add a <strong>Code Embed</strong> element and paste the HTML from Studio. Custom code needs a paid Site plan, and the Designer may only show a placeholder, so check the published site. In a CMS collection, keep each item&#39;s embed URL in a plain-text field and insert it into the <code>src</code>.</p>\n<p>Webflow&#39;s <strong>Video</strong> element does <strong>not</strong> take Verse links. It only accepts providers on Embedly&#39;s list, and Verse is not on that list yet. More: <code>integrations/embeds/webflow/README.md</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"link-previews-whatsapp-slack-linkedin-imessage-x-facebook\">Link previews (WhatsApp, Slack, LinkedIn, iMessage, X, Facebook)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#link-previews-whatsapp-slack-linkedin-imessage-x-facebook\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Every share link previews with the scene&#39;s title and poster. Verse share pages carry Open Graph and Twitter card tags, plus an oEmbed discovery link for tools that embed (WordPress, Notion-style editors). The poster is the one Verse captured when the scene was first opened, or the one you attached in Studio.</p>\n<h2 id=\"private-scenes\">Private scenes<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#private-scenes\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-8\">#</a></h2>\n<p>A private scene embeds through a share link. In the Embed panel, press <strong>Create an embed share link</strong>. The token goes into the embed code, the shortcode and the link. To switch every embed of it off, revoke that share link (Studio → the scene → Visibility). Without a valid token, an embed, a link preview or an oEmbed lookup reveals nothing: the answer is the same as for a scene that does not exist.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-visitors-get\">What visitors get<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-visitors-get\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-9\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong>The poster first</strong>, with the scene&#39;s name and a <strong>View in 3D</strong> button. The page paints immediately.</li><li><strong>The 3D loads when it is on screen.</strong> With <em>On tap</em>, it loads only after a tap.</li><li><strong>On phones, the page still scrolls.</strong> A vertical swipe over the scene scrolls your page. A sideways drag turns the scene, and a tap hands every gesture to the scene. On desktop, the mouse wheel scrolls the page until the visitor clicks into the scene (or holds Ctrl / ⌘).</li><li><strong>A fullscreen button</strong> in the top-right corner. iPhone Safari does not allow fullscreen inside frames, so there the button opens the full viewer in a new tab.</li><li><strong>Your enquiry button</strong> (set on the Studio analytics page, under &quot;Enquiry button&quot;), drawn over the 3D as on the share link.</li><li><strong>Analytics</strong>: embed views are counted under <em>Arrived via: embed</em> on your <a href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-analytics-page\">analytics page</a>. Use <code>&amp;analytics=0</code> (or <code>analytics: false</code> in the JS SDK) to count nothing.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"for-developers\">For developers<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#for-developers\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-10\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li>oEmbed: <code>GET https://verse.ctruh.com/oembed?url=&lt;share link&gt;&amp;maxwidth=&amp;maxheight=</code> (<a href=\"/docs/api#oembed\" id=\"lnk-api\">API</a>).</li><li>The JS SDK (<code>embed.js</code>, <a href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk\">Embed SDK</a>) frames the same viewer and adds events and control (<code>viewer.on(&quot;loaded&quot;)</code>, <code>setVariant</code>, …). It takes the same <code>guard</code> and <code>fullscreen</code> options.</li></ul></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#the-quickest-way-studio-embed\" id=\"lnk-the-quickest-way-studio-embed\">The quickest way: Studio → Embed</a><a href=\"#any-website-plain-html-wix-squarespace-framer-elementor\" id=\"lnk-any-website-plain-html-wix-squarespace-f\">Any website (plain HTML, Wix, Squarespace, Framer, Elementor)</a><a href=\"#wordpress\" id=\"lnk-wordpress\">WordPress</a><a href=\"#shopify-product-pages\" id=\"lnk-shopify-product-pages\">Shopify (product pages)</a><a href=\"#webflow\" id=\"lnk-webflow\">Webflow</a><a href=\"#link-previews-whatsapp-slack-linkedin-imessage-x-facebook\" id=\"lnk-link-previews-whatsapp-slack-linkedin-im\">Link previews (WhatsApp, Slack, LinkedIn, iMessage, X, Facebook)</a><a href=\"#private-scenes\" id=\"lnk-private-scenes\">Private scenes</a><a href=\"#what-visitors-get\" id=\"lnk-what-visitors-get\">What visitors get</a><a href=\"#for-developers\" id=\"lnk-for-developers\">For developers</a></aside></section>"}